{"product_id":"bloodchild","title":"Bloodchild","description":"\u003cp\u003eWill lies in a deserted lane. All he knows is that he's had an accident \u0026amp; that his life is slipping away. Against all the odds he survives - but with an almost total loss of memory. He does not even know himself. At night he is tormented by visions, in the daytime by hostile strangers. Why does he have so many enemies?\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Tim Bowler\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780192728715\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 352\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 24 x 200\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41763036594329,"sku":"9RA9780192728715","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/bloodchild-978121.jpg?v=1694789846","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/bloodchild","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}